1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,281
Every process is a chain of small pushes.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:09,370
Four to one, twice. 16 times slower.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,200
So everything after it waits.

4
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:16,470
Then, all at once.

5
00:00:17,888 --> 00:00:21,810
A chain runs at the pace of its slowest link.

6
00:00:22,088 --> 00:00:26,138
Trace it back: more than half the time went to one link.

7
00:00:29,688 --> 00:00:34,535
So change only that link. Swap one pair for equal gears.

8
00:00:37,988 --> 00:00:42,188
Same chain. Same pushes. Six seconds sooner.

9
00:00:53,688 --> 00:00:57,707
Don't hurry the fast links. Find the one that waits.
